flowchart TD
    Start([User Visits Application]) --> CheckSession{Session Exists?}

    CheckSession -->|No| ShowLogin[Show Login Page]
    CheckSession -->|Yes| ValidateSession{Valid Session?}

    ValidateSession -->|Yes| CheckOrg{Organization Selected?}
    ValidateSession -->|No| ShowLogin

    ShowLogin --> UserChoice{Choose Auth Type}

    UserChoice -->|Admin Access| AccountOAuth[Account OAuth Flow]
    UserChoice -->|Workspace Access| WorkspaceOAuth[Workspace OAuth Flow]

    AccountOAuth --> DatabricksAccountAuth[Databricks Account Login]
    DatabricksAccountAuth --> AccountTokens[Receive Account Tokens]
    AccountTokens --> CreateUser[Create/Update User in DB]
    CreateUser --> CreateSession[Create Better-Auth Session]
    CreateSession --> Dashboard[Redirect to Dashboard]

    WorkspaceOAuth --> SelectWorkspace[Select Workspace]
    SelectWorkspace --> DatabricksWorkspaceAuth[Databricks Workspace OAuth]
    DatabricksWorkspaceAuth --> WorkspaceTokens[Receive Workspace Tokens]
    WorkspaceTokens --> LinkToOrg[Link to Organization]
    LinkToOrg --> CreateUser

    CheckOrg -->|Yes| LoadOrgContext[Load Organization Context]
    CheckOrg -->|No| SelectOrg[Show Organization Selector]

    SelectOrg --> LoadOrgContext
    LoadOrgContext --> Dashboard

    Dashboard --> UserActions{User Action}

    UserActions -->|Switch Org| SwitchOrgFlow[Organization Switch Flow]
    UserActions -->|API Call| ValidateToken{Valid Token?}
    UserActions -->|Logout| ClearSession[Clear Session & Tokens]

    ValidateToken -->|Yes| ExecuteAPI[Execute API Call]
    ValidateToken -->|No| RefreshToken[Refresh Token Flow]

    RefreshToken --> CheckRefresh{Refresh Success?}
    CheckRefresh -->|Yes| ExecuteAPI
    CheckRefresh -->|No| ForceReauth[Force Re-authentication]

    SwitchOrgFlow --> UpdateSession[Update Session Context]
    UpdateSession --> LoadNewOrg[Load New Organization Data]
    LoadNewOrg --> Dashboard

    ClearSession --> Start

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style Dashboard fill:#e1f5e1
    style AccountOAuth fill:#ffe1e1
    style WorkspaceOAuth fill:#e1e5ff
    style CreateSession fill:#fff4e1
    style ClearSession fill:#ffe1e1
